<title>USA: Swiss Bank holds Genzyme stake.</title>
<headline>Swiss Bank holds Genzyme stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp said it has holds the equivalent of a 5.02 percent stake or 3,586,128 common shares in Genzyme Corp.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Swiss Bank said it used approximately $25 million to buy common stocks and warrants to purchase common stocks of Genzyme as part of its routine investment activities.</p>
</text>
